            "info": {
              "description": "Focused community-maintained specification for three read operations in the Oracle REST Data Services Database API. The documented OpenAPI file is generated by a running ORDS instance, and its URL, available services, and returned fields depend on installation, database version, configuration, and caller privileges. This specification models the database/schema qualified URL form and omits other operations and the optional q filter.",
